>1. I would like to know how many nethackers play in high speed, vs.  the 
>think-it-out approach?  I think you all know what I mean.  Do you play nethack
>the way you play AD&D, or do you play it the way you play Mario Bros.?

Depends on character type, situation, etc.  Tourists and Healers and
Rogues I tend to play slower in general.  Barbarians, Valkyries, and
Cavemen I tend to run around slashing first, and looking second (whoops,
what was that I just killed?  Oh well, who cares, it's dead.)  :-)

However, if I'm in a tight situation (low on HP, stuck with hordes of
nasties attacking), I'll slow down, and start looking carefully at my
options no matter what I'm playing.

>   Which works best for you?

Slow and careful.  I die a lot when I don't need to.  OTOH, I have fun
doing it, which is the bottom line.  :-)

